  "question": {
    "text": "The plane <math><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is rotated through a right angle about its line of intersection with the plane <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the equation of the plane in its new position is <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is",
