  "solution": {
    "text": "The equation of the plane through the line of intersection of the planes is<br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Which is parallel to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math><br /><math><mn>23</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>23</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />and&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>81</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>106</mn></math><br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>106</mn></math>",
